---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Font Identifier"
  description="Terms of service for using Font Identifier's free font identification tools."
  path="/terms-of-service/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-slate-500">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-indigo-600">Home</a> <span class="mx-1">/</span> Terms of Service
    </nav>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">The service</h2>
      <p>
        Font Identifier provides free font-identification aids: visual comparison tools, a
        question-based font finder, and a browsable font library. The tools suggest candidate
        fonts from a curated library; suggestions are guidance, not guaranteed identification.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use the site for any lawful purpose. Do not attempt to disrupt the site, scrape
        it aggressively in ways that degrade service for others, or misrepresent the site's
        output as something it is not.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Fonts and licensing</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts previewed on this site are served from Google Fonts and are subject to their own
        open licenses (mostly the SIL Open Font License). A font being free to preview or
        download does not automatically permit every commercial use — check the license of any
        font before using it in a commercial project.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">No affiliation</h2>
      <p>
        This site is an independent project by FK Digital Media and is not affiliated with
        Google, MyFonts, Adobe, or any font foundry.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for
        decisions you make based on font suggestions (for example, brand or licensing choices) —
        always verify a font's identity and license independently for important uses.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms as the site evolves; continued use of the site constitutes
        acceptance of the current terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
